# Windows (actions/actions_windows.kbd)
**windows + spc**        -- Show All
**windows + ent**        -- Maximize
**windows + lsft + ent** -- Fullscreen
**windows + rsft + ent** -- Fullscreen
**windows + k**          -- Half Up
**windows + j**          -- Half Down
**windows + h**          -- Half Left
**windows + l**          -- Half Right
**windows + close**      -- Close
**windows + toggle**     -- Apps Toggle
